<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I wait three days in silent guilt</l><l>I wish the Lord forgot.</l><l>I wonder, could He love me still</l><l>Is now my only thought</l><l>But when He speaks my name so soft—</l><l>Though others note it not—</l><l>New hope and joy now fill my heart</l><l>As He these tidings brought:</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Your words my heart shall ever sing,</l><l>And strengthen me to turn.</l><l>Since willingly You died for me,</l><l>Your love won’t cease to burn.</l><l>I failed and fell, yet You still came</l><l>And loved me e’en in sin.</l><l>So now when I feel far away</l><l>I hear these words again:</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Now with Your love and strength’ning power</l><l>Your sheep I’d shepherd here,</l><l>And with this love You showed me now</l><l>I’d feed the flock, so dear.</l><l>This feeding builds the church in love—</l><l>The love I felt that day.</l><l>The Lord will never give us up.</l><l>In faith, these words I say:</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
